          <th>Do</th>
          <th>Check</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Step"><strong>Pick a topic and audience</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Do">Choose one theme you can sustain</td>
          <td data-label="Check">Write who it is for</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Step"><strong>Outline segments</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Do">Opening, two segments and close</td>
          <td data-label="Check">Total time under ten minutes</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Step"><strong>Script key lines only</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Do">Avoid reading everything</td>
          <td data-label="Check">Keep a natural tone</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Step"><strong>Record and review</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Do">Listen for pace and filler words</td>
          <td data-label="Check">Redo once</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Step"><strong>Share for feedback</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Do">Ask three listeners for honest comments</td>
          <td data-label="Check">Note one change</td>
        </tr>
