  <h2 id="rjethics">Ethics and honesty in voice and hosting work</h2>

  <p>
    Audiences trust voices, so honesty matters. Do not read advertising copy that makes false claims, and disclose sponsored content clearly.
  </p>
  <p>
    Respect privacy when hosting events or interviews and ask permission before recording or sharing clips.
  </p>
